  "body": "Colleagues discovered that Chromium rejects when attempting to set a cookie for a public suffix domain, rather than letting \"receives a cookie\" take care of that (which would result in resolving).\n\nWe will match that behavior as it's better for web developers.\n\nBut this needs to be defined.\n\ncc @RupinMittal @bakulf",
